+# Documented one-off: New Year's Day 2011 fell on a Saturday, and CME Globex
+# Energy and Metals stayed open on the preceding Friday (2010-12-31) with an
+# early close rather than observing it as a holiday.
+# https://github.com/rsheftel/pandas_market_calendars/issues/340
+# https://github.com/rsheftel/pandas_market_calendars/files/14588227/2011-new-years.pdf
+USNewYearsDayBeforeSaturday = Holiday(
+    "New Years Day (early close, observed Friday before a Saturday)",
+    month=12,
+    day=31,
+    start_date=Timestamp("2010-12-31"),
+    end_date=Timestamp("2010-12-31"),
+)
